{"version":1,"content":"<p>「歌神」陳奕迅（Eason）日前擔任衛蘭（Janice）紅館演唱會壓軸嘉賓，男女靚聲王同台合唱，令粉絲耳朵也懷孕，大叫個唱值回票價，而網上再發布彩蛋，公開Eason在台下鮮有人知的秘密，原來做嘉賓都好忙，並非「拍拍籮柚」就走人。</p><p>&lt;br</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T04:23:55.745367+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T04:01:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T04:17:11.957244+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T04:17:11.957244+00:00","content_hash":"dc82b20ae5db6b7aba71920e6c686849b06db192af865f997097fdf2ee510f0d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}